Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 02:57:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Apply Molly's backup timer rule to the latest message
 revision

AI-assisted compatibility changes. The port excluded a message from backups
when any earlier revision had a started disappearing timer, and dropped
messages whose revision chain contained a cycle. Walk revisions as Signal
does, stopping at a cycle, and apply Molly's started-timer exclusion to the
revision the walk ends on.

